{"name":"Aqua Spring","hex":"#e8f3e8","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"aqua","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Water (as a compound).","A shade of colour, usually a mix of blue and green, most often similar to the colour cyan, though also sometimes closer to turquoise or aquamarine."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a greenish-blue colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/aqua"},{"term":"spring","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To move or burst forth.","To appear."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An act of springing: a leap, a jump.","The season of the year in temperate regions in which temperatures and daylight hours rise, and plants spring from the ground and into bloom and dormant animals spring to life."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/spring"}],"entries":[{"title":"Aqua (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Aqua was a Danish eurodance band, best known for their 1997 single \"Barbie Girl\". The group formed in 1995 in Copenhagen and achieved international success around the world in the late 1990s and early 2000s. The band released three albums: Aquarium in 1997, Aquarius in 2000 and Megalomania in 2011. The group sold an estimated 33 million albums and singles, making them the most profitable Danish band ever."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Aqua_performing_at_Caesars_Windsor%2C_Windsor%2C_Ontario%2C_2025-09-26_30.jpg/330px-Aqua_performing_at_Caesars_Windsor%2C_Windsor%2C_Ontario%2C_2025-09-26_30.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aqua_(band)","wikidata":"Q213388"},{"title":"Aqua (user interface)","blocks":[{"text":"Aqua is a graphical user interface, design language and visual theme used in Apple's macOS operating system. It was themed to replicate water, with \"droplet-like\" components and a heavy use of reflective effects and translucency. Its goal was to \"incorporate color, depth, and complex textures into a visually appealing interface\" in macOS applications. At its introduction, Steve Jobs noted that \"... it's liquid, one of the design goals was when you saw it you wanted to lick it\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/78/Macosxpb.png/330px-Macosxpb.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aqua_(user_interface)","wikidata":"Q622898"},{"title":"Aqua (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Aqua is a variation of the color cyan. The normalized color coordinates for the two web colors named aqua and cyan are identical. It was one of the three secondary colors of the RGB color model used on computer and television displays. In the HSV color wheel aqua is precisely halfway between blue and green. However, aqua is not the same as the primary subtractive color named process cyan used in printing."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Shaheed_Island%2C_Andamans%2C_Bay%2C_Turquoise_water.jpg/330px-Shaheed_Island%2C_Andamans%2C_Bay%2C_Turquoise_water.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aqua_(color)","wikidata":"Q372733"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Aqua_Gron_Concert_2008.jpg/500px-Aqua_Gron_Concert_2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Aqua_Gron_Concert_2008.jpg/500px-Aqua_Gron_Concert_2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Aqua at the Grøn Koncert in 2008 (from left: Rasted, Dif, Nystrøm, Norreen)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAqua_Gron_Concert_2008.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Aqua_performing_at_Caesars_Windsor%2C_Windsor%2C_Ontario%2C_2025-09-26_03.jpg/500px-Aqua_performing_at_Ca